neral information in short written or spoken conversations"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le12ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Beach Activities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Beach activities like <span class=\"italic\">swimming</span> or <span class=\"italic\">snorkeling</span> are nouns. Many of these nouns come from verbs.<br/> You add <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span> to the verb. <br/>Sometimes, you have to double the final letter before you add -ing.  <br/>When you talk about many of these activities, you use the verb <span class=\"italic\">go</span> + activity. <br/>You don't use go with the verb <span class=\"italic\">play</span> or <span class=-\"italic\">build</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I don't know if I should go diving or snorkeling. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to swim\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swimming\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to dive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"diving\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to snorkel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"snorkeling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to suntan\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"suntanning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to play (volleyball)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"playing (volleyball)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to build (a sandcastle)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"building (sandcastles)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you like to go swimming in the ocean?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Let's go suntanning this afternoon."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "diver "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who goes scuba diving"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is a really good diver."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about going scuba diving."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "swimming in deep water, usually with special equipment like an air tank"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  You should go for a dive in the feeding areas off the Baja peninsula. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shark"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "large animal of the ocean"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those are the best places to see manta rays and sharks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "underwater "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "below the surface of water"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can use underwater photography and video."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "excellent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "great; amazing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have a lesson with one of our excellent instructors."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "peninsula"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a narrow piece of land surrounded by ocean"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Scuba diving is great off the Baja peninsula. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find information online about places in the world where you can go scuba diving or snorkeling."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find places on different continents."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of 10 places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, choose the best 5 places you want to visit."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss why you chose those places."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify other places in the world."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of other places in the world."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss my preferences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make choices based on my preferences."}]}], "type": "sena"}